        {
          "id": 1021517022,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Not sure if this is a good idea. Although the operator < is overloaded internally with sorting column < initially, Qt:SortOrder is not being considered. What is more, also you can change the internal comparison by setting \"sortColumn\", which in turn will result in the list be sorted completely differently than it is initially and done by this original code.\n\nSo this is not a 1:1 replacement, but changes behavior.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2498449,
            "username": "rknall",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Roland Knall",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
